        {
            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Figure 4 Example of OOBN: (a) top-level hyper-network; (b) flow of information from the top-level hyper-network (OOBN) to lower-level sub-networks (BNs); (c) expanded sub-network of Instance 1; (d) expanded sub-network of Instance 2.</div>\n",
